ass="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>Sliding window通过三个核心机制提升性能：减少计算量、优化内存使用和kernel层面的计算剪枝。</p>
<h2 class="group">性能提升原理  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. 计算量减少  </h3>
<p>Sliding window限制每个query只能attend到最近的N个token，将attention复杂度从O(n²)降低到O(n×window_size)。</p>
<h3 class="group">2. 内存优化  </h3>
<p>只保留滑动窗口内的KV cache，丢弃窗口外的token，大幅减少内存占用。</p>
<h3 class="group">3. 计算剪枝  </h3>
<p>在kernel层面通过tile pruning跳过不必要的计算块。</p>
<h2 class="group">关键源码位置  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. KV Cache管理 - 计算跳过的token  </h3>
<p>在<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">SlidingWindowManager.get_num_skipped_tokens</code>中计算需要跳过的token数量 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">single_type_kv_cache_manager.py:463-489</span> 。</p>
<p><strong>断点建议</strong>：在此函数设置断点，观察跳过的token数量。</p>
<h3 class="group">2. Triton Kernel - Tile Pruning  </h3>
<p>在<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">kernel_unified_attention_2d</code>中实现tile级别的计算剪枝 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">triton_unified_attention.py:198-219</span> 。</p>
