 [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><h2 class="group">Sliding Window Attention三个层面的详细实现  </h2>
<h3 class="group">一、Attention Mask限制层面  </h3>
<h4 class="group">1. FlexAttentionBackend - get_sliding_window_mask_mod</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：通过mask函数限制attention计算范围，确保query只能attend到滑动窗口内的key。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">get_sliding_window_mask_mod</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self</span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; _mask_mod_signature:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""创建滑动窗口mask函数  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    注意：这里的滑动窗口mask是双向的，需要与encoder/decoder的  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    因果mask结合使用。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.sliding_window </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">is</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>:  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">raise</span><span> ValueError(</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"sliding_window must be set for sliding window attention"</span><span>)  
</span>  
<span>    </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">sliding_window_mask_mod</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">        b: torch.Tensor, h: torch.Tensor, q_idx: torch.Tensor, kv_idx: torch.Tensor  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    </span><span class="hljs-function">):</span><span>  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 核心逻辑：计算query和key的绝对距离  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 只有距离小于sliding_window的pair才能attend  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> torch.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">abs</span><span>(q_idx - kv_idx) &lt; self.sliding_window  
</span>  
<span>    </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">final_mask_mod</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">        b: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">        h: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">        q_idx: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">        physical_kv_idx: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    </span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; torch.Tensor:</span><span>  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将物理索引转换为逻辑索引  </span><span>
</span>        (is_valid, logical_q_idx, logical_kv_idx) = (  
            self._convert_physical_to_logical(self.doc_ids, q_idx, physical_kv_idx)  
        )  
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 只对有效索引应用mask  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> torch.where(  
</span>            is_valid,  
            sliding_window_mask_mod(b, h, logical_q_idx, logical_kv_idx),  
<span>            </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">False</span><span>,  
</span>        )  
  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 根据是否是因果attention决定是否需要索引转换  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> final_mask_mod </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.causal </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">else</span><span> sliding_window_mask_mod</span></code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">2. get_mask_mod - 组合多个mask</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：将滑动窗口mask与因果mask（decoder）或双向mask（encoder）组合。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">get_mask_mod</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self</span><span class="hljs-function">):</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># Stage-1: 初始化基础mask（decoder用causal，encoder用bidirectional）  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.causal:  
</span>        mask_mod = self.get_causal_mask_mod()  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">else</span><span>:  
</span>        mask_mod = self.get_bidirectional_mask_mod()  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># Stage-2: 添加滑动窗口mask  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.sliding_window </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">is</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">not</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>:  
</span>        sliding_window_mask_mod = self.get_sliding_window_mask_mod()  
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 使用and操作组合两个mask  </span><span>
</span>        mask_mod = and_masks(mask_mod, sliding_window_mask_mod)  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> mask_mod</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">二、KV Cache管理层面  </h3>
<h4 class="group">1. SlidingWindowManager - get_num_skipped_tokens</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：计算有多少token因为超出滑动窗口而被跳过，这些token的KV cache可以被释放。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">get_num_skipped_tokens</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self, num_computed_tokens: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function">:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""获取将被跳过的token数量  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    对于滑动窗口，这对应于当前滑动窗口之前的token。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    示例：  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    sliding_window=4, num_computed_tokens=7  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    Tokens:   [ 0  1  2  3  4  5  6  7 ]  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">              | ---- computed -----|  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">                                     ^ 下一个要计算的token  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">                          |-----------| 下一个token的滑动窗口  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">              |--skipped---|  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    当前窗口包含tokens 4~7。Tokens 0~3将被跳过，  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    因为它们在滑动窗口外。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    因此，get_num_skipped_tokens(7) == 4。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算公式：已计算token数 - 窗口大小 + 1  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># +1是因为当前token本身也包含在窗口内  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> num_computed_tokens - self.sliding_window + </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span></code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">2. remove_skipped_blocks - 释放超出窗口的blocks</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：实际释放超出滑动窗口的KV cache blocks，回收内存。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">remove_skipped_blocks</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self, request_id: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">str</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">, num_computed_tokens: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span class="hljs-function">:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""移除并释放attention计算不再需要的blocks  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    移除的blocks应该被替换为null_block。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    Args:  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        request_id: 请求ID  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        num_computed_tokens: 已计算的token数量  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算需要跳过的token数量  </span><span>
</span>    num_skipped_tokens = self.get_num_skipped_tokens(num_computed_tokens)  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> num_skipped_tokens &lt;= </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>:  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 所有token都在attention窗口内，不需要释放任何blocks  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 典型情况：full attention在请求完成前不会释放任何token  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span>  
</span>      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将token数量转换为block数量  </span><span>
</span>    num_skipped_blocks = num_skipped_tokens // self.block_size  
    blocks = self.req_to_blocks[request_id]  
<span>    removed_blocks: </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">list</span><span>[KVCacheBlock] = []  
</span>      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 从后往前遍历，释放完整的blocks  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 因为block从索引0开始，第num_skipped_blocks个block对应索引num_skipped_blocks-1  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">for</span><span> i </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">in</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">range</span><span>(num_skipped_blocks - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>, -</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>, -</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>):  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> blocks[i] == self._null_block:  
</span><span>            </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 如果已经是null block，前面的blocks也应该已经被设置为null  </span><span>
</span><span>            </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">break</span><span>  
</span>        removed_blocks.append(blocks[i])  
        blocks[i] = self._null_block  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将blocks归还到block pool  </span><span>
</span>    self.block_pool.free_blocks(removed_blocks)</code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">3. SlidingWindowSpec - 内存使用优化</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：只为滑动窗口内的token分配KV cache，大幅减少内存使用。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">max_memory_usage_bytes</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">self, vllm_config: VllmConfig</span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function">:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""计算最大内存使用量  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    在chunked prefill期间，我们只为最后的sliding_window-1个  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    已计算token加上新调度的token分配KV cache。  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算需要分配的token数量  </span><span>
</span><span>    num_tokens = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">min</span><span>(  
</span><span>        self.sliding_window - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span> + max_num_batched_tokens,   
</span>        max_model_len  
    )  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># +1是因为滑动窗口可能不从block的开始位置开始  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 例如：block_size=4，num_token=4，我们需要两个blocks [XXCD] [EF]  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 来存储6个token的滑动窗口 [CDEF]  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> (cdiv(num_tokens, self.block_size) + </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>) * self.page_size_bytes</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">三、Kernel计算优化层面  </h3>
<h4 class="group">1. Triton Kernel - Tile Pruning</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：在计算attention之前，先确定需要处理的tile范围，跳过超出滑动窗口的tiles。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># ---- Sliding-window tile pruning ----  </span><span>
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 默认：保持之前的全局行为  </span><span>
</span><span>tile_start = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>  
</span>tile_end = num_tiles  
  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> SLIDING_WINDOW &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>:  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 当前Q-block覆盖的query行  </span><span>
</span>    qpos_lo = q_block_local_idx * BLOCK_Q  
    qpos_hi = tl.minimum(  
<span>        qpos_lo + (BLOCK_M - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>) // num_queries_per_kv,  
</span><span>        cur_batch_query_len - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>,  
</span>    )  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 对于滑动窗口，每个query位置q只能attend到  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># keys在范围 [q_abs - SLIDING_WINDOW + 1, q_abs] 内  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 其中 q_abs = context_len + q  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 这个Q-block允许的key位置的并集是：  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># [context_len + qpos_lo - SLIDING_WINDOW + 1, context_len + qpos_hi]  </span><span>
</span><span>    first_allowed_key = context_len + qpos_lo - SLIDING_WINDOW + </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>  
</span>    last_allowed_key = context_len + qpos_hi  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 转换为tile索引并限制范围  </span><span>
</span><span>    tile_start = tl.maximum(</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>, first_allowed_key // TILE_SIZE)  
</span><span>    tile_end = tl.minimum((last_allowed_key // TILE_SIZE) + </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>, num_tiles)  
</span>  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 现在只在滑动窗口范围内迭代tiles  </span><span>
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">for</span><span> j </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">in</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">range</span><span>(tile_start, tile_end):  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># ... attention计算 ...</span></code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">2. Attention Score Mask应用</h4>
<p><strong>设计思路</strong>：在计算attention score后，应用滑动窗口mask将超出窗口的score设为-inf。</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算attention score  </span><span>
</span>S = tl.zeros(shape=(BLOCK_M, TILE_SIZE), dtype=tl.float32)  
S += scale * tl.dot(Q, K)  
  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 应用其他mask（causal mask等）  </span><span>
</span>S = tl.where(  
<span>    query_mask_1[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>] &amp; query_mask_0[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>] &amp; seq_mask,   
</span>    S,   
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">float</span><span>(</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"-inf"</span><span>)  
</span>)  
  
