</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> SLIDING_WINDOW &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>:  
</span>    S = tl.where(  
<span>        (context_len + query_pos[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>] - seq_offset) &lt; SLIDING_WINDOW,  
</span>        S,  
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">float</span><span>(</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"-inf"</span><span>),  
</span>    )</code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">3. CPU实现 - apply_mask</h4>
