] dark:bg-[#141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><h2 class="group">Block Mask构建详解  </h2>
<p>这段代码实现了causal attention下sliding window的直接构建优化，通过预先过滤掉超出滑动窗口的KV blocks来减少计算量 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:532-546</span> 。</p>
<h3 class="group">代码逐行注释说明  </h3>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 检查是否启用了sliding window且是causal attention  </span><span>
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.sliding_window </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">and</span><span> self.causal:  
</span>    device = used_pages.device  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">assert</span><span> self.doc_ids </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">is</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">not</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>  
</span>      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 为每个token创建索引 [0, 1, 2, ..., num_tokens-1]  </span><span>
</span>    token_indices = torch.arange(  
<span>        self.doc_ids.shape[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>], device=device, dtype=torch.long  
</span>    )  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算每个token的逻辑query索引  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 公式：token位置 - 序列起始位置 + decode偏移  </span><span>
</span>    logical_q_idx = (  
        token_indices  
        - self.query_start_loc[self.doc_ids]  
        + self.decode_offset[self.doc_ids]  
    )  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算每个query能attend到的最小KV索引  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># sliding_window - 1 是因为窗口包含当前token本身  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># clamp确保索引不小于0  </span><span>
</span>    min_kv_idx = torch.clamp(  
<span>        logical_q_idx - (self.sliding_window - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>), </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">min</span><span>=</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>  
</span>    )  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将token索引转换为block索引  </span><span>
</span>    min_block_idx = min_kv_idx // self.block_size  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 创建sliding mask：只有block索引 &gt;= min_block_idx的block才保留  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># logical_block_ids是[0, 1, 2, ..., max_blocks]的tensor  </span><span>
</span><span>    sliding_mask = self.logical_block_ids &gt;= min_block_idx[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>]  
</span>      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将超出滑动窗口的block标记为0（无效）  </span><span>
</span><span>    used_pages.masked_fill_(~sliding_mask, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">核心设计思路  </h3>
<ol>
<li>
<p><strong>直接构建优化</strong>：避免使用通用的<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">create_block_mask</code>函数，直接计算需要的blocks，性能更高 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:497-503</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Block级别过滤</strong>：在block级别而非token级别进行过滤，大幅减少需要处理的数据量</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>利用因果性</strong>：对于causal attention，query i只能attend到位置≤i的token，结合sliding window进一步缩小范围</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="group">性能提升原理  </h3>
<p>通过这个优化：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>减少内存访问</strong>：只加载滑动窗口内的KV blocks</li>
<li><strong>降低计算复杂度</strong>：attention计算从O(n²)降到O(n×window_size)</li>
<li><strong>提前过滤</strong>：在attention计算前就排除无效blocks，避免无效计算</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">使用流程  </h3>
<ol>
<li>
<p>在<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">FlexAttentionMetadata.__post_init__</code>中，如果<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">direct_build=True</code>且是causal attention，会调用<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">_build_block_mask_direct</code> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:601-604</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>生成的<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_mask</code>传递给<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">flex_attention_compiled</code>进行实际的attention计算 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:874-883</span></p>
</li>
<li>
<p>FlexAttention根据block_mask只处理有效的KV blocks，实现性能提升</p>
</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li>这个优化仅适用于causal attention，bidirectional attention使用不同的构建方式</li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">direct_build</code>需要PyTorch 2.9+支持，否则会回退到通用的<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">build_block_mask</code>方法</li>
<li>block_size通常为16或32，窗口大小决定了实际需要加载的block数量</li>
