s="mr-1"><path d="M213.85,125.46l-112,120a8,8,0,0,1-13.69-7l14.66-73.33L45.19,143.49a8,8,0,0,1-3-13l112-120a8,8,0,0,1,13.69,7L153.18,90.9l57.63,21.61a8,8,0,0,1,3,12.95Z"></path></svg>Fast</div></div></div></div><div class="h-fit rounded-lg" style="scrollbar-width: thin; scrollbar-color: rgb(58, 58, 58) transparent;"><div class="dark:[&amp;_pre:has(code)]:bg-shade dark:[&amp;_code[data-lang]]:bg-shade relative flex max-w-none flex-col gap-1 rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-[#d0d0d0] bg-[#f8f8f8] p-4 text-white [overflow-wrap:anywhere] dark:border-[#2F2F2F] dark:bg-[#141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><h2 class="group">block_mask的作用机制  </h2>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_mask</code>在<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">flex_attention</code>中通过限制需要处理的KV blocks来实现加速，它定义了每个query block只需要attend到哪些KV blocks。</p>
<h3 class="group">block_mask的结构和形状  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_mask</code>是一个<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">BlockMask</code>对象，包含以下关键字段 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:560-568</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>block_mask_kwargs = {  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"seq_lengths"</span><span>: (self.num_actual_tokens, self.total_cache_tokens),  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"kv_num_blocks"</span><span>: kv_num_blocks[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>],  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># [B, H, G] - 每组的block数  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"kv_indices"</span><span>: kv_indices[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>],        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># [B, H, G, max_blocks] - block索引  </span><span>
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"full_kv_num_blocks"</span><span>: </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>,  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"full_kv_indices"</span><span>: </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>,  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"BLOCK_SIZE"</span><span>: (self.q_block_size, self.kv_block_size),  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"mask_mod"</span><span>: self.mask_mod,  
</span>}</code></pre></pre>
<p>形状说明：</p>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">kv_num_blocks</code>: <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[batch_size, num_heads, num_groups]</code> - 每个query组需要处理的KV block数量</li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">kv_indices</code>: <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[batch_size, num_heads, num_groups, max_blocks_per_group]</code> - 实际要处理的KV block索引</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">加速机制  </h3>
<h4 class="group">1. 减少内存访问</h4>
<p>通过只加载必要的KV blocks，大幅减少内存带宽需求 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:528-546</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 直接构建路径：预先过滤blocks  </span><span>
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> self.sliding_window </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">and</span><span> self.causal:  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算滑动窗口内的最小block索引  </span><span>
</span><span>    min_kv_idx = torch.clamp(logical_q_idx - (self.sliding_window - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>), </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">min</span><span>=</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)  
</span>    min_block_idx = min_kv_idx // self.block_size  
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 创建mask，只保留窗口内的blocks  </span><span>
</span><span>    sliding_mask = self.logical_block_ids &gt;= min_block_idx[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>]  
</span><span>    used_pages.masked_fill_(~sliding_mask, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)</span></code></pre></pre>
<h4 class="group">2. 降低计算复杂度</h4>
<p>将attention计算从O(n²)降到O(n×window_size)，通过限制每个query的attention范围。</p>
<h4 class="group">3. Kernel级优化</h4>
<p>FlexAttention kernel根据<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_mask</code>只处理指定的KV blocks，跳过无效计算 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:874-883</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>out = flex_attention_compiled(  
</span>    query,  
    key_tensor,  
    value_tensor,  
    attn_metadata.transformed_score_mod,  
<span>    attn_metadata.block_mask,  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 指导kernel只处理有效blocks  </span><span>
</span>    self.scale,  
    enable_gqa=enable_gqa,  
    kernel_options=kernel_options,  
)</code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">两种构建路径  </h3>
<h4 class="group">1. 直接构建路径（高性能）</h4>
<p>适用于causal attention，直接计算需要的blocks <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:497-503</span> ：</p>
