141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><h2 class="group">Sliding Window Attention的KV位置计算  </h2>
<p>在sliding window attention中，每个query只能attend到滑动窗口内的KV tokens。你提到的Query 0计算KV positions 368-511，Query 1计算369-511，这是由sliding window的机制决定的。</p>
<h3 class="group">计算原理  </h3>
<p>以序列长度512、滑动窗口128为例 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:532-546</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算每个query能attend到的最小KV索引  </span><span>
</span><span>min_kv_idx = torch.clamp(logical_q_idx - (self.sliding_window - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>), </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">min</span><span>=</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">具体计算过程  </h3>
<p>假设decode场景，当前生成了4个token（positions 504-507）：</p>
<ol>
<li><strong>Query 0 (position 504)</strong>:
<ul>
<li>窗口范围: [504-128+1, 504] = [377, 504]</li>
<li>对应的block范围: [377//16, 504//16] = [23, 31]</li>
<li>实际KV positions: 368-511 (block 23的起始位置到序列末尾)</li>
</ul>
</li>
<li><strong>Query 1 (position 505)</strong>:
<ul>
<li>窗口范围: [505-128+1, 505] = [378, 505]</li>
<li>对应的block范围: [378//16, 505//16] = [23, 31]</li>
<li>实际KV positions: 369-511 (block 23内偏移1到序列末尾)</li>
</ul>
</li>
</ol>
<h3 class="group">为什么是368而不是377？  </h3>
<p>这是因为block对齐导致的 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:543-546</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将token索引转换为block索引  </span><span>
</span>min_block_idx = min_kv_idx // self.block_size  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 创建sliding mask，只保留完整的blocks  </span><span>
</span><span>sliding_mask = self.logical_block_ids &gt;= min_block_idx[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>]</span></code></pre></pre>
<ul>
<li>block_size = 16</li>
<li>Query 0的min_block_idx = 377//16 = 23</li>
<li>Block 23覆盖的token范围是 [23×16, 24×16) = [368, 384)</li>
<li>因此Query 0实际从position 368开始计算</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">性能优化意义  </h3>
<p>这种block级别的对齐虽然会多计算一些token（如368-376），但：</p>
<ol>
<li>简化了内存管理</li>
<li>减少了block边界处理</li>
<li>提高了并行计算效率</li>
</ol>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li>Sliding window通过block对齐实现，会包含窗口外的完整block</li>
<li>实际计算的KV数量可能略大于理论窗口大小</li>
<li>这是性能优化和实现复杂度之间的权衡</li>
