<p>要在NPU设备上实现sliding window，你需要直接对<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_tables</code>进行预处理，因为<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu._npu_paged_attention</code>只接受<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_tables</code>和<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">seq_lens</code>参数。</p>
<h3 class="group">核心实现思路  </h3>
<p>参考vLLM的直接构建路径逻辑 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:532-546</span> ，在调用NPU算子前预处理block_tables：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">mask_block_tables_for_sliding_window</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    block_tables: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    seq_lens: torch.Tensor,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    sliding_window: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    block_size: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">,  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params"></span><span class="hljs-function">) -&gt; torch.Tensor:</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    为sliding window掩码block_tables  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    Args:  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        block_tables: [num_seqs, max_num_blocks_per_seq] 原始block table  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        seq_lens: [num_seqs] 每个序列的实际长度  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        sliding_window: 滑动窗口大小  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        block_size: 每个block的token数量  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">      
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    Returns:  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">        掩码后的block_tables，超出滑动窗口的block被设为0  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span><span>  
</span><span>    num_seqs = block_tables.shape[</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>]  
</span>    masked_block_tables = block_tables.clone()  
      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">for</span><span> seq_idx </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">in</span><span> </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">range</span><span>(num_seqs):  
</span>        seq_len = seq_lens[seq_idx].item()  
          
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算当前序列需要保留的block数量  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 滑动窗口内的token数 = min(seq_len, sliding_window)  </span><span>
</span><span>        window_tokens = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">min</span><span>(seq_len, sliding_window)  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 需要保留的block数 = ceil(window_tokens / block_size)  </span><span>
</span><span>        num_blocks_to_keep = (window_tokens + block_size - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>) // block_size  
</span>          
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 计算第一个需要保留的block索引  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 序列总block数  </span><span>
</span><span>        total_blocks = (seq_len + block_size - </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>) // block_size  
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 第一个保留的block索引  </span><span>
</span>        first_block_idx = total_blocks - num_blocks_to_keep  
          
<span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 将超出滑动窗口的block设为0  </span><span>
</span><span>        </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">if</span><span> first_block_idx &gt; </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>:  
</span><span>            masked_block_tables[seq_idx, :first_block_idx] = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>  
</span>      
<span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">return</span><span> masked_block_tables</span></code></pre></pre>
