nywhere] dark:border-[#2F2F2F] dark:bg-[#141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><h2 class="group">效果不完全一样  </h2>
<p>两种实现方式的效果<strong>不完全一样</strong>，主要差异在于mask的粒度：</p>
<h3 class="group">原始实现（per-token级别）  </h3>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>used_pages.masked_fill_(~sliding_mask, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)</span></code></pre></pre>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">sliding_mask</code>形状：<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[num_tokens, num_blocks]</code></li>
<li>每个token有独立的mask，可以精确控制每个token访问哪些blocks <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:545-546</span></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">NPU适配版本（per-sequence级别）  </h3>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span>seq_mask = sliding_mask[start:end].</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">any</span><span>(dim=</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)  
</span><span>masked_block_tables[seq_idx, ~seq_mask] = </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span></code></pre></pre>
<ul>
<li>对序列内所有token的mask取并集</li>
<li>整个序列共享同一个block_table mask</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">关键差异  </h3>






























<table><thead><tr><th>方面</th><th>原始实现</th><th>NPU适配版本</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Mask粒度</td><td>per-token</td><td>per-sequence</td></tr><tr><td>精确度</td><td>每个token精确控制</td><td>包含额外blocks</td></tr><tr><td>硬件兼容</td><td>FlexAttention</td><td>NPU paged attention</td></tr><tr><td>性能</td><td>更优</td><td>略低但可用</td></tr></tbody></table>
<h3 class="group">为什么需要适配？  </h3>
<p>NPU的<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">torch_npu._npu_paged_attention</code>算子限制：</p>
<ul>
<li>输入：<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_tables</code> <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[num_seqs, max_blocks]</code></li>
<li>要求：每个序列只有一个统一的block_table</li>
<li>无法支持per-token的动态block选择</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">实际影响  </h3>
<p>NPU版本会包含一些额外的blocks：</p>
<ul>
<li>假设序列有3个token，分别需要blocks [20-25], [22-27], [24-29]</li>
<li>原始实现：token0用[20-25], token1用[22-27], token2用[24-29]</li>
<li>NPU版本：所有token都用[20-29]（并集）</li>
</ul>
<p>虽然计算量略有增加，但这是NPU硬件限制下的必要妥协，确保了功能正确性。</p>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li>两种实现在语义上等价，但性能特征不同</li>
<li>NPU版本的额外计算量通常很小（最多一个block的误差）</li>
<li>这是硬件约束和软件优化之间的权衡</li>
<li>实际部署时，这种差异对整体性能影响有限</li>
