<p><strong>原始vLLM代码</strong> <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:532-546</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># sliding_mask形状: [num_tokens, num_blocks]  </span><span>
</span><span>sliding_mask = self.logical_block_ids &gt;= min_block_idx[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>]  
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># used_pages形状: [num_tokens, num_blocks]   </span><span>
</span><span>used_pages.masked_fill_(~sliding_mask, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 形状匹配，可以直接操作</span></code></pre></pre>
<p><strong>NPU实现</strong>：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># sliding_mask形状: [num_tokens, num_blocks]  </span><span>
</span><span>sliding_mask = logical_block_ids &gt;= min_block_idx[:, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">None</span><span>]  
</span><span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># block_tables形状: [num_seqs, num_blocks]  </span><span>
</span><span>masked_block_tables.masked_fill_(~sliding_mask, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)  </span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 形状不匹配！</span></code></pre></pre>
<h3 class="group">具体问题  </h3>
<ul>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">sliding_mask</code>: <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[3, 32]</code> (3个token，32个blocks)</li>
<li><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">block_tables</code>: <code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">[2, 32]</code> (2个序列，32个blocks)</li>
</ul>
<p>无法直接将3×32的mask应用到2×32的张量上。</p>
<h3 class="group">解决方案  </h3>
<p>必须先将per-token的mask聚合为per-sequence的mask <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">flex_attention.py:51-56</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 使用scatter_add_聚合token级别的mask到序列级别  </span><span>
</span><span>seq_mask = torch.zeros(num_seqs, max_blocks, dtype=torch.</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">bool</span><span>, device=device)  
</span><span>seq_mask.scatter_add_(</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>, doc_ids.unsqueeze(</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>).expand(-</span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">1</span><span>, max_blocks), sliding_mask)  
</span>  
<span></span><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 现在seq_mask形状: [num_seqs, num_blocks]，可以应用  </span><span>
</span><span>masked_block_tables = torch.where(seq_mask, block_tables, </span><span style="color: rgb(0, 128, 128);">0</span><span>)</span></code></pre></pre>
<h2 class="group">Notes  </h2>
<ul>
<li>形状不匹配是NPU硬件限制导致的根本问题</li>
<li>原始FlexAttention支持per-token的动态block选择</li>
<li>NPU的paged_attention算子只支持per-sequence的统一block table</li>
<li>聚合操作会包含一些额外blocks，这是必要的性能权衡</li>
