ark:[&amp;_code[data-lang]]:bg-shade relative flex max-w-none flex-col gap-1 rounded-md border-[0.5px] border-[#d0d0d0] bg-[#f8f8f8] p-4 text-white [overflow-wrap:anywhere] dark:border-[#2F2F2F] dark:bg-[#141414] [&amp;_pre]:my-3"><div class="prose-custom prose-custom-md prose-custom-gray !max-w-none text-neutral-300 [overflow-wrap:anywhere]"><p>vLLM通过专门的端到端测试和attention后端对比测试来验证sliding window的精度，确保与base模型（full attention）相比没有掉点。</p>
<h2 class="group">精度验证方法  </h2>
<h3 class="group">1. 端到端正确性测试  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">tests/v1/e2e/test_correctness_sliding_window.py</code>是专门验证sliding window精度的核心测试 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">test_correctness_sliding_window.py:35-78</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">test_sliding_window_retrieval</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    model, batch_size, seed, disable_hybrid_kv_cache_manager  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params"></span><span class="hljs-function">):</span><span>  
</span><span>    </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">"""  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    The test does a bunch of assignments "x1 = 10\nx2 = 33\n..." and then  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    asks for value of one of them (which is outside the sliding window).  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    If we tell it upfront which we are going to be looking for, then  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    it answers correctly (mostly).  
</span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">    """</span></code></pre></pre>
<p>测试通过以下方式验证精度：</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>检索任务测试</strong>：创建超出滑动窗口范围的变量赋值，然后查询这些变量值</li>
<li><strong>答案验证</strong>：使用<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">check_answers</code>函数验证模型输出是否正确 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">test_correctness_sliding_window.py:64-69</span></li>
<li><strong>接受率检查</strong>：设置<code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">accept_rate=1.0</code>要求100%正确率</li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">2. Attention后端对比测试  </h3>
<p><code class="rounded-sm bg-[#e5e5e5] px-[0.25rem] py-[0.20rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] before:hidden after:hidden dark:bg-[#484848]/30">tests/v1/attention/test_attention_backends.py</code>通过对比不同attention后端的输出来验证精度 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">test_attention_backends.py:604-654</span> ：</p>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-weight: bold;">def</span><span class="hljs-function"> </span><span class="hljs-function" style="color: rgb(153, 0, 0); font-weight: bold;">test_sliding_window_backend_correctness</span><span class="hljs-function">(</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">    batch_spec_name: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">str</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">, model: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">str</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">, tensor_parallel_size: </span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params" style="color: rgb(0, 134, 179);">int</span><span class="hljs-function hljs-params">  
