<h3 class="group">硬件要求  </h3>
<p><strong>GPU要求</strong>：</p>
<ul>
<li>NVIDIA GPU with compute capability 7.0或更高（V100、T4、RTX20xx、A100、L4、H100等） <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">gpu.cuda.inc.md:8</span></li>
<li>显存：建议至少16GB（用于运行sliding window测试）</li>
<li>系统：Linux（不支持Windows原生） <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">gpu.md:19-23</span></li>
</ul>
<p><strong>软件要求</strong>：</p>
<ul>
<li>Python：3.10-3.13 <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">gpu.md:20</span></li>
<li>CUDA：12.1-13.0（推荐12.8） <span role="link" tabindex="0" class="bg-pacific/10 text-pacific active:bg-pacific/20 hover:bg-pacific/20 cursor-pointer rounded-md px-[0.25rem] py-[0.12rem] text-xs font-normal leading-[15px] transition-colors duration-100 before:hidden after:hidden" style="font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, &quot;IBM Plex Mono Fallback&quot;; font-weight: 400; font-style: normal;">gpu.cuda.inc.md:3</span></li>
</ul>
<h3 class="group">安装步骤  </h3>
<h4 class="group">方式一：使用预编译wheel（推荐）</h4>
<pre class="px-2 py-1.5 has-[code]:rounded-md has-[code]:!bg-[#e5e5e5] has-[div]:bg-transparent has-[div]:!p-0 has-[code]:text-stone-900 dark:has-[code]:!bg-[#242424] has-[code]:dark:text-white [&amp;_code]:block [&amp;_code]:border-none [&amp;_code]:bg-transparent [&amp;_code]:p-0"><pre style="display: block; overflow-x: auto; padding: 6px 8px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); background: transparent; margin: 0px; width: 100%;"><code style="white-space: pre; font-size: 12px;"><span style="color: rgb(153, 153, 136); font-style: italic;"># 1. 创建虚拟环境  </span><span>
</span><span>uv venv </span><span class="hljs-params">--python</span><span> 3.12 </span><span class="hljs-params">--seed</span><span>  
</span><span>source </span><span style="color: rgb(221, 17, 68);">.venv/bin/activate</span><span>  
